            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Philanthropy and Public Speaking</strong><br>\nAfter leaving office, Kohl engaged in various philanthropic activities and was a sought-after speaker on global political issues, often discussing the importance of a united Europe.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Personal Life and Controversies</strong><br>\nKohl's political career also faced controversies, including a campaign finance scandal that tarnished his reputation. Despite this, he was respected for his diplomatic skills and vision for Germany and Europe.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Death and Legacy</strong><br>\nHelmut Kohl passed away on June 16, 2017. He left a profound legacy as the architect of German reunification and a principal advocate for European unity.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
